WEBVTT

00:11:32.902 --> 00:11:34.152
(Music ends)

00:11:37.069 --> 00:11:40.069
That's my friend Simran Singh
playing the dilruba.

00:11:41.027 --> 00:11:44.253
When I play it, it sounds
like a cat's dying somewhere,

00:11:44.277 --> 00:11:45.545
so you're welcome.

00:11:45.569 --> 00:11:48.212
(Laughter)

00:11:48.236 --> 00:11:51.212
This instrument is in my home today,

00:11:51.236 --> 00:11:53.277
but it doesn't actually belong to me.

00:11:54.777 --> 00:11:57.277
It's my role to shepherd it in time,

00:11:58.444 --> 00:12:01.861
and that feels more meaningful to me
than just owning it for today.